# A view no imported file covers (far from the fixture's tiles), at the fixture's deepest level (15: a converted
# folder's bounds are that level's extent, the engine's record): "No map here". Zoomed out to 14 the plate goes (the
# shallower levels of a converted folder are not bounded by the record).
title No map here
sizes 640x480 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 45.75,4.85,15

wait 1000
shot no-map-here
expect text "No map here"
key pgdn
wait 800
expect notext "No map here"
key esc
expect quit
